    "justification_quote": "The counterexample relies on a false premise: it assumes that the mere presence of inflammatory mediators in neuroinflammation models (e.g., LPS treatment) automatically invalidates the specific causal claim about trophic factors. The literal assertion states that microglia regulate synaptic stabilization *by releasing trophic factors*. This describes a mechanism, not an exclusive one.",
